  triage:title "clippy too_many_arguments: record_task_outcome grew to 8 parameters" ;
  triage:description "cargo clippy --all-targets --all-features -D warnings fails on atm-http-runtime: the AXPE-RBQ-002 fix threaded the AsyncTaskLedgerReader into record_task_outcome as an eighth parameter, tripping clippy::too_many_arguments. Reproduced by quality-mgr on the worktree; baseline 7f65db491 passes. Remediation: reduce the parameter count structurally (e.g. a small crate-private context struct carrying reader + task_store + member, or carry the reader on the pump tick context the way escalate_blocked already reaches it); never add #[allow(clippy::too_many_arguments)]. RULE-003: herdr_queue_wake.rs is at the cap, so any new type lives in a sibling module." ;
